0 A science-fiction platform pairs a curved ribbed barrier with a raised turret carrying a dish and short barrel.
0 Name: HOSE_FLEXIBLE_19L-Constraints.ldr
0 Author: Holly Wood
0 Unofficial Model
0 // Scene: Angular wall pieces form a low enclosure on one side. A thick column supports a broad equipment head on the other, while a dark segmented strip bows around the front; straight hose samples lie apart from the platform.
0 // Rigid construction: System slopes and corner plates shape the platform. Large 6259 cylinders, a turntable, side-stud bricks, a dish, clips and small cylindrical fittings build the elevated head.
0 // Build lesson: Use a few large industrial shapes - plinth, column, equipment head and perimeter rail - then add smaller fittings at visible interfaces.
0 // Reuse: The bowed strip is a hose-shape demonstration, not a certified railing. The supplied synthesis references missing 57539a/b geometry, so its hose-detail preview is incomplete.
